  "description": "⭐ <strong>Horrible Histories has taken over the museum! Tours end 13 September.</strong><br><br> Horrible Histories has joined forces with Ramses and the Pharaohs' Gold: The Exhibition, to present a hugely fun tour of the Awesome Egyptians! Take a terrible tour of priceless Egyptian artefacts with the great Ramses himself! Discover the foul facts of death and decay with the meanest mummies in Egypt. Go through the Gates of the Afterlife, hear tales of Tutankhamun and come face to face with a Pharaoh! It's the history of Egypt with the nasty bits left in!<br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> 🤣 Take a guided tour like no other, with Ramses himself as your guide.<br> 📣 Hear first hand, awesome stories about Ramses the Great, the most powerful pharaoh in history.<br> 🎤 Sing along to the Mummy Rap and discover the foul facts of mummification.<br> 🤩 Discover 180 original royal treasures over 3,000 years old.<br> 🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for <em>Ramses and the Pharaohs' Gold: The Exhibition </em><a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/677108\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> ⭐ Produced by the maestro’s of Horrible Histories, the Birmingham Stage Company<br> 📅 Horrible Histories Tours run until 13 September<br> ⏲ Select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br> 📍 Location: NEON at Battersea Power Station<br> 👤 Age requirement: recommended age is 5+<br> 📌 Looking for Ramses and the Pharaohs’ Gold? Book standard exhibition tickets <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/503872\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br> 📩 For Carer tickets, please contact Fever <a href=\"https://support.feverup.com/hc/en-us/requests/new\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br> ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://www.ramsestheexhibition.co.uk/london/faqs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br><br><strong>Description</strong><br> The tour begins inside the exhibition, where you are welcomed by Ramses II and his loyal guard. Together, they will guide you through a priceless collection of original Egyptian artefacts, including the coffin of Ramses the Great, colossal statues, exquisite jewellery and even some mummified pets, all 3,000 years old.<br><br> Along the way, discover why Egyptians mummified their dead, learn about the dangerous journey through the Afterlife and uncover the secrets behind the reign of Ramses the Great, one of the most powerful and influential pharaohs in history.<br><br> The tour continues with a laugh-out-loud performance of Making Mummies, featuring the infamous Mummy Rap! Experience first-hand how pharaohs were turned into a mummies, as this fascinating burial ritual is brought hilariously to life!<br><br> Meet Ramses. Discover Ancient Egypt. Laugh Through History. Get your tickets today!<br><br><em>The tour contains elements from Horrible Histories current touring production of Awful Egyptians.</em><br><em>The exhibition is produced by Victory Hill Exhibitions Ltd (part of NEON Group) in partnership with the Egypt’s Supreme Council of Antiquities and the Egyptian Museum.&nbsp;</em><br>",
